        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>RFC 9132 — DOTS Signal Channel Protocol — Page 46</title>\n<script>\nwindow.MathJax = {\n  tex: {\n    inlineMath: [['$', '$']],\n    displayMath: [['$$', '$$']]\n  }\n};\n</script>\n<script async src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\"></script>\n<style>\n  * {\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n  }\n\n  html,\n  body {\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 0;\n    background: #ffffff;\n    color: #171717;\n  }\n\n  body {\n    font-family: \"Times New Roman\", Times, serif;\n  }\n\n  .page {\n    position: relative;\n    width: 1653px;\n    height: 2339px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    overflow: hidden;\n    background: #ffffff;\n  }\n\n  .page-header {\n    position: absolute;\n    top: 96px;\n    left: 155px;\n    width: 1342px;\n    height: 62px;\n    border-bottom: 2px solid #cccccc;\n    font-size: 28px;\n    line-height: 34px;\n  }\n\n  .header-row,\n  .footer-row {\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr 1fr;\n    align-items: center;\n  }\n\n  .header-left,\n  .footer-left {\n    text-align: left;\n  }\n\n  .header-center,\n  .footer-center {\n    text-align: center;\n  }\n\n  .header-right,\n  .footer-right {\n    text-align: right;\n  }\n\n  main {\n    position: absolute;\n    top: 195px;\n    left: 183px;\n    width: 1287px;\n    font-size: 31px;\n    line-height: 1.22;\n  }\n\n  p {\n    margin: 0;\n  }\n\n  a {\n    color: #1717aa;\n    text-decoration: none;\n  }\n\n  strong {\n    font-weight: 700;\n  }\n\n  .continuation {\n    width: 1200px;\n    margin-left: 55px;\n    padding-left: 56px;\n    border-left: 2px solid #dddddd;\n    font-size: 31px;\n    line-height: 1.22;\n  }\n\n  .paragraph-one {\n    margin-top: 28px;\n  }\n\n  .paragraph-two {\n    margin-top: 27px;\n  }\n\n  .protocol-figure {\n    margin: 30px 0 0 0;\n    padding: 0;\n  }\n\n  .code-box {\n    width: 1287px;\n    height: 352px;\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 29px 58px;\n    border: 2px solid #e4e4e4;\n    background: #fbfbfb;\n  }\n\n  .code-box pre {\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 0;\n    white-space: pre;\n    font-family: \"Courier New\", Courier, monospace;\n    font-size: 27px;\n    line-height: 29.5px;\n    color: #202020;\n  }\n\n  figcaption {\n    margin-top: 29px;\n    font-size: 29px;\n    line-height: 35px;\n    font-style: italic;\n  }\n\n  .after-figure {\n    margin-top: 30px;\n  }\n\n  .definition {\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: 83px 1fr;\n    column-gap: 0;\n    margin-top: 60px;\n  }\n\n  .definition-term {\n    font-size: 30px;\n    line-height: 1.22;\n  }\n\n  .definition-body {\n    font-size: 30px;\n    line-height: 1.22;\n  }\n\n  .mandatory {\n    margin-top: 29px;\n  }\n\n  .page-footer {\n    position: absolute;\n    left: 155px;\n    bottom: 292px;\n    width: 1342px;\n    height: 66px;\n    padding-top: 28px;\n    border-top: 2px solid #cccccc;\n    font-size: 27px;\n    line-height: 33px;\n  }\n\n  @media (max-width: 1653px) {\n    .page {\n      transform-origin: top left;\n    }\n  }\n\n  @media print {\n    .page {\n      margin: 0;\n    }\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"page\">\n  <header class=\"page-header\">\n    <div class=\"header-row\">\n      <div class=\"header-left\">RFC 9132</div>\n      <div class=\"header-center\">DOTS Signal Channel Protocol</div>\n      <div class=\"header-right\">September 2021</div>\n    </div>\n  </header>\n\n  <main>\n    <div class=\"continuation\">\n      encrypted DOTS heartbeat request\"/'heartbeat- interval') or ((\"size of encrypted<br>\n      DOTS heartbeat request\" + \"average size of an encrypted mitigation<br>\n      request\")/'heartbeat- interval'). Absent any explicit configuration or inability to<br>\n      dynamically adjust 'probing-rate' values (<a href=\"#\">Section 4.8.1</a> of [<a href=\"#\">RFC7252</a>]), DOTS agents<br>\n      use 5 bytes/second as a default 'probing-rate' value.\n    </div>\n\n    <p class=\"paragraph-one\">\n      If the DOTS agent wishes to change the default values of message transmission parameters, it<br>\n      <strong>SHOULD</strong> follow the guidance given in <a href=\"#\">Section 4.8.1</a> of [<a href=\"#\">RFC7252</a>]. The DOTS agents <strong>MUST</strong> use the<br>\n      negotiated values for message transmission parameters and default values for non-negotiated<br>\n      message transmission parameters.\n    </p>\n\n    <p class=\"paragraph-two\">\n      The signal channel session configuration is applicable to a single DOTS signal channel session<br>\n      between DOTS agents, so the 'cuid' Uri-Path <strong>MUST NOT</strong> be used.\n    </p>\n\n    <figure class=\"protocol-figure\">\n      <div class=\"code-box\">\n<pre>Header: PUT (Code=0.03)\nUri-Path: \".well-known\"\nUri-Path: \"dots\"\nUri-Path: \"config\"\nUri-Path: \"sid=123\"\nContent-Format: \"application/dots+cbor\"\n\n{\n ...\n}</pre>\n      </div>\n      <figcaption>Figure 21: PUT to Convey the DOTS Signal Channel Session Configuration Data</figcaption>\n    </figure>\n\n    <p class=\"after-figure\">\n      The additional Uri-Path parameter to those defined in <a href=\"#\">Table 1</a> is as follows:\n    </p>\n\n    <div class=\"definition\">\n      <div class=\"definition-term\">sid:</div>\n      <div class=\"definition-body\">\n        <p>\n          Session Identifier is an identifier for the DOTS signal channel session configuration data<br>\n          represented as an integer. This identifier <strong>MUST</strong> be generated by DOTS clients. 'sid' values<br>\n          <strong>MUST</strong> increase monotonically (when a new PUT is generated by a DOTS client to convey the<br>\n          configuration parameters for the signal channel).\n        </p>\n        <p class=\"mandatory\">This is a mandatory attribute.</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </main>\n\n  <footer class=\"page-footer\">\n    <div class=\"footer-row\">\n      <div class=\"footer-left\">Boucadair, et al.</div>\n      <div class=\"footer-center\">Standards Track</div>\n      <div class=\"footer-right\">Page 46</div>\n    </div>\n  </footer>\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>"
